  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1: The backoffice package manifest now ships correctly - the project uses the Razor SDK with StaticWebAssetBasePath so umbraco-package.json is packed and discovered under App_Plugins/utpro-geo-location/, and the manifest version stays in sync with the package version. No runtime changes. v1.0.0: Initial release. IP-based geolocation with CDN header detection (Cloudflare, AWS, Azure) and offline MMDB fallback. Country-to-culture mapping, Umbraco middleware integration, and configurable provider chain.",
